earch7","snippet":"# Writing for the web - write for your audience ... * Capitalise the first letter of each bullet if it contains full sentences, and","title":"Writing for the web - write for your audience | Government Communication and Information System (GCIS)","url":"https://www.gcis.gov.za/guidelines/website/writing-web-write-your-audience"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.opm.gov","ref_id":"turn0search8","snippet":"Plain language is grammatically correct and universally understood language that includes complete sentence structure and accurate word usage. Plain language is not unprofessional writing or","title":"Plain Language","url":"https://www.opm.gov/information-management/plain-language/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"assets.openstax.org","ref_id":"turn0search14","snippet":"completing the square a process for solving quadratic equations in which terms are added to or subtracted from both sides ... discriminant the expression under","title":"College Algebra","url":"https://assets.openstax.org/oscms-prodcms/media/documents/CollegeAlgebra-OP.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.stylemanual.gov.au","ref_id":"turn0search9","snippet":"Writing in plain language helps everyone. ... * write short sentences. ... Start each paragraph with a topic sentence that introduces the topic.","title":"Quick guide: plain language | Style Manual","url":"https://www.stylemanual.gov.au/style-manual-resources/quick-guides/quick-guide-plain-language"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.cdc.gov","ref_id":"turn0search10","snippet":"* Find hidden verbs and fix passive sentences in your writing ... Keep your sentences and paragraphs short and focused. ... Now, the speech is","title":"Get to the Point: Write for Immediate Understanding | NCEH | CDC","url":"https://www.cdc.gov/nceh/clearwriting/mod2/index.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.inklestudios.com","ref_id":"turn0search11","snippet":"That’s why we’ve created inklewriter, to help writers tell interactive tales with the minimum of fuss. inklewriter keeps your branching story organised, so you can","title":"inklewriter","url":"https://www.inklestudios.com/inklewriter/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"assets.openstax.org","ref_id":"turn0search15","snippet":"Throughout the solution the static friction is taken as equal to \"μs x N\", but this is the MAXIMUM static friction, which is NOT the","title":"<table id=\"e1\">","url":"https://assets.openstax.org/oscms-prodcms/media/documents/University_Physics_Vol_1_Release_Notes_2025.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.oregon.gov","ref_id":"turn0search16","snippet":"When material is in plain language, the audience finds what it needs, understands ... voice, long sentences, and other common writing ...  Use short,","title":"Use “Plain Language” to improve your writing","url":"https://www.oregon.gov/das/Docs/plain_language_guide.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.archives.gov","ref_id":"turn0search17","snippet":"Plain language is clear, concise, organized, and appropriate for the intended audience. ... Use short sentences as much as possible. ... www.nara-at-work.gov/plain-language/","title":"NARA’s “Top 10” Principles for Plain Language","url":"https://www.archives.gov/files/open/plain-writing/plain-language-top-ten.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search18","snippet":"The Center for Plain Language states that: \"[a] document, web site or other information is in plain language if the target audience can read it,","title":"Plain language","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plain_language"}]}}
