{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"web_search","id":"exec-ed540951-0e0d-4155-91aa-39133f106b61","query":"site:support.greenhouse.io resume parsing columns tables headers footers","action":{"type":"search","query":"site:support.greenhouse.io resume parsing columns tables headers footers"},"results":[{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search0","snippet":"In some cases, the resume parse might be partially successful (automatically filling some information, but skipping others). ... If the candidate has a need to","title":"Unsuccessful resume parse – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/200989175-Unsuccessful-resume-parse"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search1","snippet":"# Resume parsing with non-English languages","title":"Resume parsing with non-English languages – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/205019689-Resume-parsing-with-non-English-languages"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search2","snippet":"* Resume parsing with non-English languages ... * Unsuccessful resume parse","title":"Resumes – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/sections/360000690451-Resumes"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search3","snippet":"Parsetalent effortlessly enhances your experience by simplifying complex processes like parsing CVs, editing intricate job descriptions, and finding the perfect candidate match—all within seconds. ...","title":"Parsetalent integration – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/37962063973403-Parsetalent-integration"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search4","snippet":"Greenhouse parses the resumes with ML models and extracts skills, job titles, years of experience, start/end dates of employment, and company names from employment history","title":"Talent Matching - Data Processing FAQ – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/41131616864283-Talent-Matching-Data-Processing-FAQ"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search5","snippet":"AI Screened CV Results | Long text | Written resume assessment and requirement-level evidence. ... Screened Error - Resume Unreadable | The resume file could","title":"AI Screened integration – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/29122364864539-AI-Screened-integration"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search6","snippet":"To enable match scores, a Site Admin must go to Configure > AI Tools and turn on the two toggles under Resume parsing and Talent","title":"Talent Matching setup – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/45126074890523-Talent-Matching-setup"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search7","snippet":"* Our Chrome extension had some trouble parsing information from resumes. No one likes extra typing, and you can now parse again to your heart’s","title":"Recruiting Release Notes: 2018 - March 14 – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/360001746091-Recruiting-Release-Notes-2018-March-14"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search8","snippet":"Tip: If you add date columns to your spreadsheet, enter dates in `YYYY-MM-DD` format and set the column format to Text first so your spreadsheet","title":"Bulk import candidates from spreadsheet – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/360053674012-Bulk-import-candidates-from-spreadsheet"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search9","snippet":"* Resume parsing with non-English languages * Format job posts for right-to-left language orientation","title":"Change your preferred language in Greenhouse Recruiting – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/360030667232-Change-your-preferred-language-in-Greenhouse-Recruiting"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search10","snippet":"* Google Chrome's update (version 72) on January 30, 2019 broke the drag and drop resume parsing functionality of the Greenhouse Prospecting Chrome Plugin.","title":"Release Notes Jan 10 – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/360038181272-Release-Notes-Jan-10"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search11","snippet":"Check out the table below to find the error name from your email, along with details on how to solve it. ... If one of","title":"HRIS Link job import errors – Greenhouse Support","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/articles/360059154811-HRIS-Link-job-import-errors"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search12","snippet":"Because Site Admins users have access to all jobs, a Site Admin can submit a referral to any job in your Greenhouse Recruiting account. ...","title":"Note: A user can make a referral to any job with a live external job post, as well as to any job where they have been assigned permissions. This means a Basic user can submit referrals only to jobs which have a live external job post, while a Job Admin user can submit a referral to any of their assigned jobs (as well as to any job with a live external job post). Because Site Admins users have access to all jobs, a Site Admin can submit a referral to any job in your Greenhouse Recruiting account.","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/article_attachments/9576789685275"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search13","snippet":"<table id=\"e1\"> ... <th>Column Heading Override</th> <th>Column Heading Override XML Alias</th> ... Include Group Name in Headers and Subtotals","title":"<table id=\"e1\">","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/article_attachments/18956315074971"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search14","snippet":"<table id=\"e1\"> ... Include Group Name in Headers and Subtotals ... Condition as Text","title":"Edit Custom Report: Green House - Open Job Requisition","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/en-us/article_attachments/11114020734107"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search15","snippet":"Columns <table id=\"e1\"> ... <th>Column Heading Override</th> <th>Column Heading Override XML Alias</th>","title":"01:23 PM  \n03/31/2020  \nPage 1 of 6\n\nReport Name","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/article_attachments/18956315074971"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"support.greenhouse.io","ref_id":"turn1search16","snippet":"Columns <table id=\"e3\"> | Business Object | Field | Column Heading Override | Column Heading Override XML Alias | Format | Options | ... </table>","title":"Edit Custom Report: Green House - Open Job Requisition","url":"https://support.greenhouse.io/hc/article_attachments/11114020734107"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"github.com","ref_id":"turn1view0","snippet":"Total lines: 3437","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/IqQT4L4YTyWvqW0UZ1qBm6jOT9evHy0DnnokuTcbPSLYR422WCqJTJUskL8DwpKSuBTEWRmeqonrLlu_xfC4dijuEzpxRcRHd869vGSzChqxQAtfsUMnqzGxroTN6FJBAxC_2KEZwwpws7DvBaUkR5t28UkpY6jH88t8GNjFeiA","title":"ink/Documentation/WritingWithInk.md at master · inkle/ink · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/inkle/ink/blob/master/Documentation/WritingWithInk.md"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"openstax.org","ref_id":"turn1view1","snippet":"Total lines: 341","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/-qbKRGX8BDLx0ulYcKAMvwoDXlthK0VIylVSZH1cHJ3kuhaYrVQM0TI_UZoCCs6u2cf_AUGxxe16rcvYh01Z6PuHYodMKwhTJmFX-XcM8SJjjLCNovquWsucxrMscVAsJDQoQa1qWbf6MIXDw8flFA","title":"6.2 Friction - University Physics Volume 1 | OpenStax","url":"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-2-friction"}]}}
